import Placeholder from '../components/Placeholder.astro';
---
<Placeholder title="Billing" description="Buying, managing and cancelling AlgoMinutes Pro.">
  <p>
    Every AlgoMinutes account gets free recording minutes each month. AlgoMinutes Pro, for more minutes, is an
    auto-renewing subscription you buy in the AlgoMinutes app on iPhone, through the App Store. The app shows the
    price and how often you're billed before you buy, and Apple charges it to your Apple Account.
  </p>
  <h2>Renewal</h2>
  <p>
    Pro renews automatically at the end of each period unless you cancel at least 24 hours before the period ends.
    If you cancel, you keep Pro until the end of the period you've paid for.
  </p>
  <h2>Manage or cancel</h2>
  <p>
    In AlgoMinutes, open <strong>Settings → Manage Subscription</strong>. Or, on your iPhone, open
    <strong>Settings</strong>, tap your name, then <strong>Subscriptions</strong>, and choose AlgoMinutes. Deleting your
    AlgoMinutes account doesn't cancel an App Store subscription, so cancel it there first.
  </p>
  <h2>Refunds</h2>
  <p>
    Apple handles App Store payments, so refunds are requested from Apple at reportaproblem.apple.com, or from your
    purchase history in your Apple account. Nothing here limits any right you have
    under the Australian Consumer Law or your local consumer laws.
  </p>
  <h2>A new iPhone</h2>
  <p>
    Sign in to the same AlgoMinutes account and Pro comes with you. If it doesn't show, choose
    <strong>Restore Purchases</strong> on the Pro screen in the app.
  </p>
</Placeholder>
